Hi all,

there is now a new wiki with information about the Linux FireWire/ IEEE 
1394 kernel drivers and related userspace software:

     http://ieee1394.wiki.kernel.org/

Its current content is almost identical with (although already more 
up-to-date than) wiki.linux1394.org.  You will discover quickly why I 
made the move if you look at the RecentChanges or TitleIndex of 
wiki.linux1394.org.

I hope you will find the new wiki useful (or if not, make it useful).
